<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS4" title="In Appendix A Framework Details ‣ Simulating and Understanding Deceptive Behaviors in Long-Horizon Interactions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.4 </span>Supervisor Agent</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS5" title="In Appendix A Framework Details ‣ Simulating and Understanding Deceptive Behaviors in Long-Horizon Interactions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.5 </span>Deception Auditor</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
